        "en": "Foncia incident updated",
        "fr": "Incident Foncia mis à jour",
        "de": "Foncia-Vorfall aktualisiert",
        "es": "Incidencia de Foncia actualizada"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "An incident or a repair was opened, or its status changed.",
